  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Precision That Saves Setup Time – »pilot 4.0« </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The ZOLLER »pilot 4.0« software measures a set of seven tools with maximum efficiency. All tools are entered one after another in a single process; their contours are automatically compared, and deviations are displayed immediately. The measurement and correction values are optimized relative to one another and transferred directly to the CN control—without repeated setup. This ensures that the entire tool set adjusts optimally, significantly reducing both setup time and machine downtime.</p>",
