  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Smart Cabinets for Diamond Tools </h2>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER Smart Cabinets enable the secure, unambiguous, and digital management of diamond tools for the stone industry. Each blade is clearly assigned, immediately locatable, and protected from damage. The stock is automatically visible at a glance, and mix-ups are prevented—ensuring fast setup processes and complete process reliability.</p> <p>Learn more about ZOLLER Smart Cabinets</p>",
